# Recipes Source Summary

Source document introducing "Recipes" as a universal mental model—a conceptual tool for navigating complexity through pattern recognition. Draws from Timothy Ferriss's *The 4-Hour Chef*, which uses recipe-based thinking (decomposing cooking into learnable components) as a framework for learning any skill. See [[recipes-mental-model]] for the concept page.